.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH mdmc-schema 1  "schema " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-schema \- Print a shipped JSON Schema to stdout
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc schema\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISCHEMA\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print a shipped JSON Schema to stdout
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fISCHEMA\fR>

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
mail\-draft: mail\-draft (the draft frontmatter contract)
.IP \(bu 2
mail\-snapshot: mail\-snapshot (the decompiled snapshot contract)
.RE
